  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nThe icons in the riot client for some rooms seemed blurry so I checked the media url and it seems to be returning the wrong size image.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- Open https://matrix.org/_matrix/media/v1/thumbnail/disroot.org/omImodskspCryApihvRjAtwG?width=48&height=48&method=crop\r\n- See that the requested size is 48x48 but it returns a 32x32 image (the original size is 96x96)\r\n\r\nThe inverse also happens on this icon:\r\nhttps://matrix.org/_matrix/media/v1/thumbnail/disroot.org/WaZoGMHggcIsSXmeYWKkgSAz?width=48&height=48&method=crop\r\nthat returns an 96x96 image instead.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\nThe issue is on matrix.org",
